<title>HONG KONG: CIBC CEF sets call warrants on Swire.</title>
<headline>CIBC CEF sets call warrants on Swire.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce, London Branch, said on Tuesday it issued 38 million American-style call warrants on shares of Swire Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$57.15	 PREMIUM	   11.35 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.356	 GEARING	   4.68X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  20.MAY.98	EXER LOT	  5,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$63.50</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
